WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:04.087
La Diva de la Banda, Jenni Rivera.

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:06.256
Good evening. 

00:00:06.256 --> 00:00:09.300
There is late word tonight that searchers
have found the wreckage...

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.469
...rescue workers searching 
for a plane have found wreckage.

00:00:11.469 --> 00:00:15.724
...jet went missing, carrying latin 
music superstar, Jenni Rivera.

00:00:17.058 --> 00:00:20.562
This was a woman poised for superstardom.

00:00:20.562 --> 00:00:21.730
Jenni got on the plane. 

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:23.732
She went into the sky
 and she never came back.

00:00:25.316 --> 00:00:28.445
The missing recorders are so critical
 to understanding this accident.

00:00:29.279 --> 00:00:31.573
So you mean to tell me they found
 Jenni Rivera's driver's license,

00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:33.908
but they couldn't find that black box. 

00:00:33.908 --> 00:00:35.827
Who needed to cover up what? 

00:00:36.661 --> 00:00:39.497
It's a dangerous life to be a singer,

00:00:39.497 --> 00:00:41.291
because these cartel, 

00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:44.419
they are more treacherous
 than a rattlesnake.

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:46.838
Boom, boom, boom, boom.

00:00:48.006 --> 00:00:51.718
[IN SPANISH]
I wanted to leave this recorded with you, since...

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:55.472
[IN SPANISH]
...if it is going to end, it will end here.

